WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.633
Matthew Chance is

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.968
OUTFRONT live in London.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.469
And Matthew,

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.270
Ukraine edging closer

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.205
to that long awaited

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:06.272
counteroffensive tonight.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.208
Already it appears dealing the worst day

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.109
to Putin's Air Force.

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.110
Not just of this war,

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.078
but in more than 50 years.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:12.345
Yeah.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.313
And if Ukraine's

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:14.247
got anything to do with it,

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.182
there will be more very bad days

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.584
for Putin in the weeks

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:18.618
and the months ahead

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.487
that Ukrainian control offensive.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:21.721
It's not quite underway yet

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.123
as far as we can make out,

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.891
but it is poised to take place.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:25.492
When it does,

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:26.626
it will be with the help

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.828
of Western training for its armies.

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:31.297
And, of course, Western weapons on that.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.767
President Vladimir Zelensky of Ukraine

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.168
has been on a European tour

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.669
for the past week,

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.971
and his officials are tonight

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.539
calling it a huge success

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.574
because they've got billions of dollars

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.743
of military aid from Germany

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.579
and more advanced weaponry from Britain

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.914
and from France.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.289
The war in Ukraine may be

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:57.724
at a turning point,

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.059
with Ukrainian forces

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.161
reporting daily advances

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:03.263
in the city of Bamako,

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.664
with Russian positions there

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.599
apparently crumbling.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.100
Even this, that

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.468
that was the tragedy tonight.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.570
Now, the extraordinary allegation

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.505
carried in The Washington Post,

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:13.339
this man,

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.707
Yevgeny Prigozhin,

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.743
the Russian Wagner mercenary leader,

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.245
offered Ukraine intelligence

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.514
on Russian military positions

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:24.117
if Kiev withdrew its troops from back

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.352
to where Wagner has been fighting

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.823
the war that he just

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.891
Prigozhin has vehemently denied it.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.027
Releasing an audio statement

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.362
accusing comrades in Moscow

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.898
of trying to discredit him personally, or

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:41.701
even Ukraine, it's dismissed any talk

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.404
with its bitter enemies.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.340
A senior Ukrainian official telling CNN

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.243
that if Prigozhin had been backchannel

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.479
without the knowledge of the Kremlin,

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:54.447
he would not be alive today.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:57.917
As he walked in.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.919
These are fraught times

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.888
for friends of the Kremlin.

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:03.022
One of its backers,

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:03.656
Alexander

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:06.092
Lukashenko of neighboring Belarus,

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:06.993
The Victory Day

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:07.994
parade in Moscow

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.028
last week

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.131
is rumored to have been taken ill.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.933
Later appearing looking uneasy

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:14.901
at a wreath

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.070
laying ceremony in his capital, Minsk,

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.373
an official in Belarus told CNN

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.742
he's, quote, absolutely fine.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.613
And now new video

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.047
said to be of Lukashenko

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.816
at work as usual,

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.018
inspecting air defenses.

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.453
But rumors abound

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.555
about the health of this aging

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.091
Kremlin backed leader

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.962
Meanwhile, a senior Ukrainian official

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.031
is calling President Zelensky's

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:47.767
European tour a huge success

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:50.970
This the latest leg

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.438
with the British prime minister

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.973
at his country residence

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.308
where attack drones

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.577
and air defense systems were pledged

00:02:58.077 --> 00:02:58.878
I look forward to us

00:02:58.878 --> 00:02:59.679
discussing what more

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.547
we can do to support

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.048
you and your country.

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:03.583
First of all, thank you very much.

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.219
Your support is already a lot for us

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.988
with British cruise missiles already

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.323
delivered to Ukraine.

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:11.057
Britain is now

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.125
at the forefront

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.460
of providing long range weapons.

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:15.662
There was no promise

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:16.729
of Game-Changing

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.665
F-16s fighter jets

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:20.600
from any European power.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.134
Still,

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:21.734
a senior

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.002
Ukrainian official tells

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.904
CNN that in time,

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:27.840
Ukraine will get the planes, the tanks

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:29.509
and the long range weapons

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.611
it needs to win this war.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.348
But, Erin, that is contingent

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:37.550
on Western support for Ukraine.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.685
Including its continued

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:39.852
provision of arms

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:41.221
holding up, particularly

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.422
from the United States,

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:45.992
because even with the latest European

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:48.161
contribution to the Ukrainian war effort,

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:49.429
it is still the U.S.

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:50.196
That's the biggest,

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:52.365
most important military backer

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:54.000
for the country Erin.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.468
All right, Matthew, thank you very much.

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:56.703
And I want to go now to retired

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:57.937
Lieutenant General Ben Hodges,

00:03:57.937 --> 00:03:58.638
because he's the former

00:03:58.638 --> 00:03:59.906
commanding general of the U.S.

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.741
Army Europe and also the former U.S.

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.643
ambassador to Russia, John Sullivan.

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:05.078
I appreciate both of you very much.

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:06.079
General Hodges,

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:07.113
I want to start with this.

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:08.248
Worse day for the Russian Air

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:10.316
Force really since 1970

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:11.251
more than 50 years,

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:12.218
certainly of this war

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:13.686
for Russian aircraft

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:15.555
downed over Russian territory

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:16.422
this weekend.

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:18.858
What impact does this have? General?

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:19.359
Well,

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.361
to lose four aircraft in one day

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:23.062
would certainly send shockwaves

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:25.064
through the aviation community

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:27.000
of the Russian Federation.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.369
Forces, just like it would anybody.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.272
I'm interested in how this happened.

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:35.341
It seems that Ukraine may have been able

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.011
to infiltrate capabilities in there.

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:40.146
Still not entirely confirmed

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:40.813
how it happened.

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.382
But if they're able to do that,

00:04:42.382 --> 00:04:44.117
that that would really demonstrate

00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:45.451
a level of sophistication

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:47.353
that will worry the Russians.

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:47.920
But it's

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:48.688
it's important

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:50.523
that Russia not be allowed

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:51.824
to have sanctuary.

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:52.725
The launch strikes

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.460
that murder innocent Ukrainian people.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.361
And so the Ukrainians

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:57.363
are going to continue to take action.

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:58.398
This, I think,

00:04:58.398 --> 00:04:59.932
and obviously to emphasize

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:02.068
on Russian territory where this happened.

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:03.403
Ambassador Sullivan, Putin's

00:05:03.403 --> 00:05:04.370
most loyal ally.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.605
But you heard Matthew reporting

00:05:05.605 --> 00:05:07.774
on the Belarusian President Lukashenko.

00:05:07.774 --> 00:05:09.309
You know, he said Belarus,

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:09.542
an air

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:11.411
defense units were placed on high alert

00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:12.178
after the downing

00:05:12.178 --> 00:05:14.314
of those Russian aircraft. Right.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.315
He is there

00:05:15.315 --> 00:05:17.216
every step of the way for Putin. Right.

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:21.054
So Belarus's role as ally is crucial

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.922
and he is the dictator there.

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:24.257
There has been such speculation

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:25.291
about his health, though,

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:27.026
Two photos of him today

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:27.493
appears to have

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:28.861
a bandage on his left wrist.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:30.863
He obviously,

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:33.166
it appears, fell ill in Moscow.

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.233
If something were wrong with him,

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:35.401
if he was no longer in power,

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:38.338
what would that do to Putin, Ambassador?

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:39.839
That's a big problem for Putin.

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:40.173
As you

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:41.641
mentioned, Erin Lukashenko,

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:44.911
President Lukashenko has as ruled Belarus

00:05:45.411 --> 00:05:46.546
as with

00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:48.214
a hard authoritarian hand

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:49.982
for almost 30 years,

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.884
was a vital supporter

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:54.520
of Putin's war against Ukraine.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.489
He's the one foreign leader

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:57.390
that Putin meets

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.392
with more than anyone else.

00:05:59.392 --> 00:06:00.593
I think he's met with in something

00:06:00.593 --> 00:06:02.028
like 14 times

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:04.263
since since the war started.

00:06:04.263 --> 00:06:07.033
So he is his most important ally.

00:06:08.134 --> 00:06:08.801
So General

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.603
Hodges, you know, most important ally,

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:11.304
but he had to leave

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:12.605
that meeting in Moscow.

00:06:12.605 --> 00:06:14.841
It appeared to take ill there

00:06:15.108 --> 00:06:16.876
and he is Putin's closest ally.

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:17.910
I'm curious, General, though,

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.112
because you seem to think

00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:20.880
that the downfall of Lukashenko

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.415
could actually give Putin something

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:23.616
that he wants,

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:24.584
possibly an excuse

00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:25.551
to end the war in Ukraine.

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:29.088
Well, I see it as an opportunity.

00:06:29.322 --> 00:06:31.691
If he is looking around for an excuse

00:06:31.991 --> 00:06:33.226
to get out of this war,

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:35.428
that he is losing terribly in Ukraine.

00:06:35.762 --> 00:06:36.629
He could

00:06:36.629 --> 00:06:38.431
I mean, the Kremlin is pretty good

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:40.233
at manufacturing fairy tales

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:42.402
to explain what it is they're doing.

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:43.102
And so in

00:06:43.102 --> 00:06:44.170
order to justify

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.439
why they might have to avoid

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.241
getting crushed

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:51.010
in Ukraine to actually withdraw.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.045
You could almost envision a scenario

00:06:53.045 --> 00:06:56.816
where the saving Belarus would be the

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:58.584
the excuse of the needs.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:01.020
Of course, I don't I don't know that.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.622
What I would really hope would happen

00:07:02.622 --> 00:07:04.524
is that the people of Belarus

00:07:04.524 --> 00:07:05.758
would see the opportunity

00:07:05.758 --> 00:07:06.993
to finally throw off

00:07:06.993 --> 00:07:09.061
the yoke of Kremlin suppression

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:10.830
as well as from their own president.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:10.997
All right.

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.031
And of course, we should note right,

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:12.865
there are opposition

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:14.667
leaders in Belarus

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:15.435
one of them

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.069
serving a 17 year prison sentence.

00:07:17.069 --> 00:07:18.337
It is a mirror image of Russia

00:07:18.337 --> 00:07:19.772
in so many ways.

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:20.640
Ambassador,

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:21.474
I want to ask you about that

00:07:21.474 --> 00:07:22.975
intelligence leak that I mentioned

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:24.510
regarding Yevgeny Prigozhin,

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.245
and this is from The Washington Post.

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:27.847
You they're saying that in the

00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.081
you know, the leaked information

00:07:29.081 --> 00:07:29.582
from that

00:07:30.583 --> 00:07:31.050
young man in

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.852
Massachusetts that Prigozhin back

00:07:32.852 --> 00:07:34.187
channeled Ukraine

00:07:34.187 --> 00:07:35.521
offered information

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:37.056
about Russian troop positions

00:07:37.056 --> 00:07:38.791
so that the Ukrainians could kill them

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:40.426
and that he could

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:42.195
then take over back mute.

00:07:42.195 --> 00:07:43.196
That would be the exchange

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:45.665
and get the credit for it.

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:47.600
True or not.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:50.603
Let's just start with how is this news

00:07:50.603 --> 00:07:54.140
impacting Putin, possibly

00:07:54.373 --> 00:07:56.409
Well, it certainly

00:07:56.409 --> 00:07:57.009
I think

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.644
what would shake

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:02.114
leaders confidence in this criminal

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:03.382
that they've put in charge

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:05.952
of this mercenary brigade.

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:08.120
Prigozhin isn't a military leader

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.555
and the Wagner Group

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:12.091
is a transnational criminal organization.

00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:15.027
So designated by the United States.

00:08:15.361 --> 00:08:16.562
This isn't a military

00:08:16.562 --> 00:08:17.830
and military leadership.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.599
This is a criminal gang.

00:08:19.599 --> 00:08:20.833
And to the extent that Putin

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:22.935
has relied on people like this

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:25.404
he's paying the price now with Prigozhin

00:08:25.571 --> 00:08:26.706
possibly doing this

00:08:26.706 --> 00:08:27.840
and at a minimum

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:28.541
saying things

00:08:28.541 --> 00:08:30.810
like the Russian minister of defense

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.211
and the chief of the general staff

00:08:32.211 --> 00:08:34.146
that they're traitors and cowards.

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:36.048
General, when you look

00:08:36.048 --> 00:08:36.682
at the state of the war

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:37.650
right now on the ground,

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.085
you come on the heels of Zelensky, right?

00:08:39.085 --> 00:08:40.520
You just heard him there

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.588
thanking the British prime minister

00:08:42.588 --> 00:08:43.923
for the support.

00:08:43.923 --> 00:08:44.190
Right.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.191
And you're getting those shadow

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.392
cruise missiles from the U.K.

00:08:46.392 --> 00:08:48.094
that give them more distance.

00:08:48.094 --> 00:08:48.961
You're getting the aid

00:08:48.961 --> 00:08:49.228
that you're

00:08:49.228 --> 00:08:50.830
getting extremely significant aid

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.199
from both the U.K. and from Germany.

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:54.834
Do you think that

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:57.870
the tide is going to change here or not?

00:08:58.571 --> 00:08:58.938
Yeah,

00:08:58.938 --> 00:09:00.273
I think we're looking

00:09:00.273 --> 00:09:00.907
at the beginning

00:09:00.907 --> 00:09:03.709
of a major momentum shift.

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:05.344
This just didn't happen by accident.

00:09:05.344 --> 00:09:05.811
Of course,

00:09:05.811 --> 00:09:07.613
Ukrainian general staff and President

00:09:07.613 --> 00:09:08.548
Joe Lenski

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:09.181
and frankly,

00:09:09.181 --> 00:09:10.149
all 50 nations

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:11.484
that support Ukraine

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:12.785
have been working very hard

00:09:12.785 --> 00:09:14.320
for the last few months.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.021
But it really was

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:18.591
Ukrainian forces that have managed

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:21.494
to put together a large armored formation

00:09:21.494 --> 00:09:23.529
that's been training and preparing

00:09:23.529 --> 00:09:26.232
while other Ukrainian forces held

00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:26.899
back, moved

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:28.234
and allowed Russian forces

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:30.002
to bleed themself there.

00:09:30.002 --> 00:09:30.903
And then when you put that

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:32.305
against all these,

00:09:32.305 --> 00:09:33.406
the other good news

00:09:33.406 --> 00:09:34.607
that's been happening,

00:09:34.607 --> 00:09:36.242
you do have the sense

00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:37.777
that we could be very close to

00:09:37.777 --> 00:09:40.780
Ukraine achieving catastrophic success

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:43.916
in this counteroffensive.

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:45.318
Preconditions, number one,

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:46.485
are the Ukrainians ready?

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:47.019
Number two,

00:09:47.019 --> 00:09:49.288
have they degraded the Russians enough?

00:09:49.288 --> 00:09:51.090
And then number three,

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.124
is the ground ready

00:09:52.124 --> 00:09:53.726
when those three conditions are set?

00:09:53.726 --> 00:09:55.261
I think General Giuliani

00:09:55.261 --> 00:09:56.329
will turn to his president

00:09:56.329 --> 00:09:57.496
and say, we're ready to go.

00:09:57.496 --> 00:09:57.964
Right.

00:09:57.964 --> 00:09:58.497
A ground

00:09:58.497 --> 00:09:59.465
that is a you know,

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:00.866
not not so soft from the melting.

00:10:00.866 --> 00:10:02.401
Thank you both so very much.

00:10:02.401 --> 00:10:03.169
I appreciate it.

